le degrees of the remainder can be 0 or 1\npossible_degrees = [0, 1]\nprint(possible_degrees)\n```\n```output\n[0, 1]\n```\nThe possible degrees of the remainder when a polynomial is divided by \\(2x^2 - 7x + 18\\) are \\(\\boxed{0, 1}\\).",
